ni bajaoge?"},{"who":"child","text":"7 taaliyaan!"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, 7 ke liye 7 taaliyaan! Ab ek aur number naam suno. Nau kaun sa ank hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"9"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, nau ka ank 9 hai. Ab main bolti hoon eight. Tum ungliyon se eight dikhaoge?"},{"who":"child","text":"haan... ungliyon se?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, ungliyon se. Dono haath ki ungliyaan khol kar gin sakte ho. Eight ungliyaan dikhaoge?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8... haan, eight ungliyaan"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, tumne eight tak gina. Main tumhari ungliyaan dekh nahi sakti. Ab socho: do rotiyaan thi, dono kha li. Kitni bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero... kyunki dono rotiyaan kha li na, toh kuch nahi bacha"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, dono rotiyaan kha li, toh zero bachi. Zero bhi ek number hai. Aaj ke liye yahin rukna hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... game khelein?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, khelte hain! Game nahi bana sakti, par bolkar khel sakte hain. Main chhe bolun toh tum hawa mein 6 banao. Nau bolun toh 9 banao. Taiyaar?"},{"who":"child","text":"haan haan!"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Chalo, bolkar khelte hain! Main bolti hoon chhe. Tum hawa mein uska ank banao. Gol hissa upar hai ya neeche?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.07613,"tokens":48299},"boards":4,"lastMs":4919,"screen":{"on":"nothing","texts":[],"words":"nothing is on the screen"},"learner":{"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s1":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i01","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i09","kind":"near_transfer"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"evidence":"Saat taaliyaan transfer sahi; pehle bhi sahi"},"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s2":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i02","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i11","kind":"retrieval"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"evidence":"Eight tak gina; ungliyaan dikhna confirm nahi"},"c1-maths-c